  "description": "Linux backend for Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Maps. Adds .UseLinuxMaps() to your MAUI app builder; renders raster tiles into a SkiaSharp surface with pan/zoom, pin/polyline/polygon/circle overlays and Street/Satellite/Hybrid map types. Also exposes a standalone SkiaMap view for code-first map UI. Street tiles come from OpenStreetMap; Satellite/Hybrid use keyless Esri World Imagery + reference layers (subject to Esri's terms of use) and are redirectable to your own tiles. Tiles are cached under $XDG_CACHE_HOME. Opt-in: install this package only if your app uses Maps on Linux.",
